<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.5">
<l>uṇṇa vāṉavar kōṉuk kāya roruppa ṭutta vaṭici luṇṭatum</l>
<l>vaṇṇamāl varaiyai yeṭuttu maḻaikāttatu</l>
<l>maṇṇai muṉpaṭait tuṇṭu miḻntuka ṭanti ṭantu maṇanta māyaṅka</l>
<l>ḷeṇṇun tōṟumeṉ ṉeñceri vāy meḻu kokkuniṉṟē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>[Your] eating the rice that was brought together by the cowherds for the king of celestials to eat,</l>
<l>[your] lifting the beautiful big mountain [and] protecting from the rain</l>
<l>and [your] wondrous deeds of once creating the earth, swallowing, disgorging, churning, scooping up [and] marrying [it],</l>
<l>whenever I consider [them] my heart is constantly like wax in the mouth of the flame.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
